12. Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 06.03.2018 passed by Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Bengaluru in MVC.No.741/2017 is modified;
iii) The claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.14,00,052/- as against Rs.6,54,000/-;
iv) The interest awarded by the tribunal at the rate of 8% per annum on the compensation amount of Rs.6,54,000/- is left undisturbed.

